sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker
    participant DB as Tenant database
    participant R as Outbox consumer
    participant P as Delivery provider
    W->>DB: Begin with local tenant context and aggregate locks
    W->>DB: Recheck due version, heads, approvals, revocations and lateness
    alt Approval pending, revoked or dependency superseded
        W->>DB: Record Blocked approval and staff alert
        Note over W,DB: Later approval requires explicit future reschedule
    else Preapproved but outage exceeds 15 minute catch-up window
        W->>DB: Record Needs staff review without publication
    else Eligible approved occurrence
        W->>DB: Insert unique publication, update live pin, insert outbox
        DB-->>W: Atomic commit
        R->>DB: Deduplicate event and create unique recipient delivery
        R->>DB: Check explicit SMS authorization, consent, quiet hours, expiry and cancellation
        alt Recipient eligible for dispatch now
            DB-->>R: Commit Dispatching
            R->>P: Submit with correlation ID and idempotency only if supported
            alt Provider returns acceptance
                P-->>R: Provider message ID
                R->>DB: Record Accepted
            else Timeout with ambiguous outcome
                R->>DB: Record Unknown and reconciliation deadline
                R->>P: Query status or await authenticated callback
                Note over R,P: No blind SMS resend or exactly-once delivery promise
            end
        else Recipient suppressed, held, deferred or expired
            R->>DB: Record channel outcome without rolling back publication
        end
    end
